### Roam Conceal Pickoff (Roam)

- Items: Tough Boots, Thunder Belt, Oracle, Fleeting Time, Dominance Ice, Immortality
- Core: Thunder Belt, Oracle, Fleeting Time
- Emblem: Support Emblem with Agility, Pull Yourself Together, Focusing Mark
- Battle spell: Flicker
- Blessing: Conceal
- Flex: Athena's Shield over Dominance Ice when Use against one-rotation magic burst when Kalea dies before Oracle healing or passive resets matter.; Antique Cuirass over Dominance Ice when Use when physical skill damage from fighters or assassins is the main threat after Kalea starts the pickoff.; Radiant Armor over Dominance Ice when Use against repeated magic poke or burn damage that chips Kalea before Conceal can create the grab angle.
- Total cost: 10560 gold

Default roam setup for hiding the Flicker or Tidal Strike angle, grabbing one carry, and cycling ultimate faster after confirmed assists.

### Roam Favor Sustain (Roam)

