- Core: Dominance Ice, Fleeting Time, Oracle
- Emblem: Support Emblem with Agility, Pull Yourself Together, Focusing Mark
- Battle spell: Flicker
- Blessing: Favor
- Flex: Thunder Belt over Athena's Shield when Use when Kalea is surviving first contact and needs the enhanced-basic slow to keep targets inside follow-up range.; Radiant Armor over Athena's Shield when Use against sustained magic damage rather than a single burst mage.; Guardian Helmet over Athena's Shield when Use when objective fights are spaced out and Kalea needs to reset health without recalling.
- Total cost: 10890 gold

Grouped-fight roam setup that leans into Favor, passive healing, and cooldown resets when Kalea is protecting carries more than flanking.

